1
00:00:00,167 --> 00:00:02,675
Why does so much of the world
rely on dollars?

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:06,441
Deep U.S. financial markets make
dollars easy to trade and hold.

3
00:00:06,567 --> 00:00:09,808
As more people accept dollars,
they become more useful to others.

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:13,381
That helps the dollar lead, but it's
not the only global currency.
